<title>CANADA: Bombardier to sell 12 mln series 2 pfds.</title>
<headline>Bombardier to sell 12 mln series 2 pfds.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bombardier Inc said on Monday it entered into an underwriting agreement to sell 12 million series 2 preferred shares at a purchase price of C$25 per share, for aggregate proceeds of C$300 million.</p>
<p>Bombardier said about C$30.5 million of the proceeds of the issue will be used to redeem on June 30, 1997, all the outstanding series 1 preferred shares.</p>
<p>The remaining proceeds will be added to the general funds, Bombardier said.</p>
<p>It said closing is expected by about May 22, 1997.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
